WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.617
Race week. Open Quick update on your phone.

2
00:00:02.617 --> 00:00:06.610
In race week, the first tile is the notice.

3
00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:12.279
Say it in one or two short sentences.

4
00:00:12.279 --> 00:00:15.203
It comes down after the last day you pick.

5
00:00:15.203 --> 00:00:20.050
Press the button. It is on
every page in a few minutes.
